---
title: Curried Rice Salad
author: Mary Arntson
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@chicken Riceroni{1%pkg}
@green pepper{1/2} (seeded and chopped)
@green onion{4} (sliced thin)
@pimento stuffed olives{12} (sliced)
@marinated artichoke hearts{2%6-oz jars}
@curry powder{3/4%tsp}
@mayonnaise{1/3%c}

Cook rice as directed and cool in large bowl. Add onions and peppers. Drain artichoke hearts - reserve marinate. Cut artichoke hearts into small pieces (cut out tough leaves). Combine marinate with curry powder and mayonnaise. Add artichoke hearts to rice and toss with dressing. Chill.
